  "system": {
    "description": "<p>The caster tests Will + {{math spellPower \"*\" 3}} against the target's Strength or Dexterity.</p><p><strong>On success:</strong> the target is trapped in the cyclone for up to three rounds and cannot act. While trapped it cannot be harmed by Physical attacks or by direct Magic such as projectiles and beams, and it can be moved one hex per round.</p><p>Can be cast as a Reaction only on an ally within range, when that ally is attacked. The ally may choose to fail the versus test.</p>",
